1
00:00:00,820 --> 00:00:03,860
(Sheldon:)I've been thinking about
Dr. Greene's efforts

2
00:00:03,860 --> 00:00:06,130
(Sheldon:)to make science palatable
for the masses.

3
00:00:06,130 --> 00:00:07,700
(Leonard:)Oh, yeah? What about it?

4
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:10,870
(Sheldon:)That's all. I've just
been thinking about it.

5
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:15,170
(Sheldon:)Now, I'm thinking
about fractal equations.

6
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:18,440
(Sheldon:)Now I'm thinking about

7
00:00:18,440 --> 00:00:21,510
(Sheldon:)the origin of the phrase
"train of thought."

8
00:00:21,510 --> 00:00:23,280
(Sheldon:)Now I'm thinking about trains.

9
00:00:25,350 --> 00:00:27,920
(Raj:)Are you listening
to this guy?

10
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:29,750
(Howard:)Hmm? Oh, I'm sorry.

11
00:00:29,750 --> 00:00:31,050
(Howard:)I was somewhere else.

12
00:00:31,060 --> 00:00:33,620
(Leonard:)Lucky bastard.

13
00:00:35,130 --> 00:00:38,530
(Sheldon:)Now I'm thinking about Jell-O.

14
00:00:38,530 --> 00:00:40,000
(Raj:)So what's up?

15
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:42,730
(Howard:)It's a Bernadette thing.

16
00:00:42,730 --> 00:00:47,300
(Raj:)Oh, no. I hope
everything's okay.

17
00:00:48,610 --> 00:00:51,770
(Leonard:)Whatever it is,
we're here for you.

18
00:00:51,780 --> 00:00:53,860
(Leonard:)You can tell us anything.

19
00:00:53,860 --> 00:00:57,020
(Raj:)Yeah. Good or
devastating.

